{"id":1040303,"chapter_id":1040303,"scene_id":1,"steps":[{"step":1,"content":"这一路走得很不安宁，你们路过倒塌的房屋，废墟。橡木匣一直保持着异常的沉默，唯一能够消解你的不安的，是她身上若有若无的独特香薰味。","style":3,"background":1046,"log_type":1,"src_id":140303001,"trial_step":1},{"step":2,"content":"你一直在想小女孩念的到底是什么，光又代表了什么。那样的念诵如果发生在修道院的人身上，大概是一种祷词，但橡木匣的反常，让你觉得这祷词可能并不如你预想的那样宁静。","style":3,"background":1046,"log_type":1,"src_id":140303002,"trial_step":2},{"step":3,"content":"这么想着，你看了看走在前面的橡木匣。","style":3,"background":1046,"log_type":1,"src_id":140303003,"trial_step":3},{"step":4,"content":"她似乎永远不会为身边的景色所停留，但她却一直是那位停下脚步，回头倾听无法再走下去的人的使者。","style":3,"background":1046,"log_type":1,"src_id":140303004,"trial_step":4},{"step":5,"speaker":"橡木匣","content":"怎么了？","voice":["vo_trial_40303_1_5"],"voice_bank":"vo_oak_trial","style":1,"background":1046,"log_type":1,"src_id":140303005,"trial_step":5},{"step":6,"content":"察觉到你没跟上，橡木匣转过身来，简短地询问。","style":3,"background":1046,"log_type":1,"src_id":140303006,"trial_step":6},{"step":7,"content":"啊……没有，只是看到这里竟然没多少居住痕迹，有点好奇。","style":2,"background":1046,"log_type":1,"src_id":140303007,"trial_step":7},{"step":8,"speaker":"橡木匣","content":"这里啊……","voice":["vo_trial_40303_1_8"],"voice_bank":"vo_oak_trial","style":1,"background":1046,"log_type":1,"src_id":140303008,"trial_step":8},{"step":9,"content":"橡木匣看向身旁的平地，眉眼间依旧淡淡的，看不出情绪。","style":3,"background":1046,"log_type":1,"src_id":140303009,"trial_step":9},{"step":10,"speaker":"橡木匣","content":"因为，这里是乱葬岗。","voice":["vo_trial_40303_1_10"],"voice_bank":"vo_oak_trial","style":1,"background":1046,"log_type":1,"src_id":140303010,"trial_step":10},{"step":11,"speaker":"橡木匣","content":"最初，流浪狗会在这附近刨食，成群结队，人们不愿靠近这里。","voice":["vo_trial_40303_1_11"],"voice_bank":"vo_oak_trial","style":1,"background":1046,"log_type":1,"src_id":140303011,"trial_step":11},{"step":12,"speaker":"橡木匣","content":"后来，为了遏制狂厄，这里被匆匆填埋，臭味没有了。但依然很少有人愿意来这一片。直到最近……大战结束，而罗马内斯克被毁，人们又重新想起了这个地方。","voice":["vo_trial_40303_1_12"],"voice_bank":"vo_oak_trial","style":1,"background":1046,"log_type":1,"src_id":140303012,"trial_step":12},{"step":13,"content":"你这才看见，原本长满荒草的土地上，有一些新的土包隆起。不远处，有人正在土包前插起一块木板，就当是给亡者立碑了。","style":3,"background":1046,"log_type":1,"src_id":140303013,"trial_step":13},{"step":14,"content":"那人一面插着木板，一面念诵着什么，他的声音随着星星点点的磷火飘在空中。","style":3,"background":1046,"log_type":1,"src_id":140303014,"trial_step":14},{"step":15,"content":"“你当度过苦厄……遇见金色的游隼……行者牵引你……”","style":3,"background":1046,"log_type":1,"src_id":140303015,"trial_step":15},{"step":16,"content":"你终于想起，执念中那些字词为何眼熟。","style":3,"background":1046,"log_type":1,"src_id":140303016,"trial_step":16},{"step":17,"options":["我曾听过那首诗"],"style":6,"background":1046,"log_type":1,"src_id":140303017,"trial_step":17,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"我曾听过那首诗","goto":18}]},{"step":18,"speaker":"橡木匣","content":"或许吧。","voice":["vo_trial_40303_1_18"],"voice_bank":"vo_oak_trial","style":1,"background":1046,"log_type":1,"src_id":140303018,"trial_step":18},{"step":19,"options":["是你念过"],"style":6,"background":1046,"log_type":1,"src_id":140303019,"trial_step":19,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"是你念过","goto":20}]},{"step":20,"content":"我曾听你念过，就在我进入审查室的时候。","style":2,"background":1046,"log_type":1,"src_id":140303020,"trial_step":20},{"step":21,"speaker":"橡木匣","content":"“你当度过苦厄，跨过这世上所有的丰碑…你当遇见金色的游隼，有翅膀的行者牵引你……”","voice":["vo_trial_40303_1_21"],"voice_bank":"vo_oak_trial","style":1,"background":1046,"log_type":1,"src_id":140303021,"trial_step":21},{"step":22,"speaker":"橡木匣","content":"……","voice":["vo_trial_40303_1_22"],"voice_bank":"vo_oak_trial","style":1,"background":1046,"log_type":1,"src_id":140303022,"trial_step":22},{"step":23,"speaker":"橡木匣","content":"接下来，你是不是想问，“你从哪里知道的这首诗”？","voice":["vo_trial_40303_1_23"],"voice_bank":"vo_oak_trial","style":1,"background":1046,"log_type":1,"src_id":140303023,"trial_step":23},{"step":24,"speaker":"橡木匣","content":"呵……这是一首往生诗，告慰死者放下一切苦难，祝福死者前往美好宁静的永恒之地。","voice":["vo_trial_40303_1_24"],"voice_bank":"vo_oak_trial","style":1,"background":1046,"log_type":1,"src_id":140303024,"trial_step":24},{"step":25,"content":"你听别人念起过吗？","style":2,"background":1046,"log_type":1,"src_id":140303025,"trial_step":25},{"step":26,"speaker":"橡木匣","content":"更准确地说，是有人为我念过。","voice":["vo_trial_40303_1_26"],"voice_bank":"vo_oak_trial","style":1,"background":1046,"log_type":1,"src_id":140303026,"trial_step":26},{"step":27,"content":"可是，你刚才说，这是给死者念诵的诗……","style":2,"background":1046,"log_type":1,"src_id":140303027,"trial_step":27},{"step":28,"content":"进入审查室前，你看过关于橡木匣的调查报告。","style":3,"background":1046,"log_type":1,"src_id":140303028,"trial_step":28},{"step":29,"content":"她出生于辛迪加最混乱的时期，自幼是孤儿，由修道院的神父收养。在她十三四岁的时候，修道院在黑帮战斗中覆灭，神父也死于那一年。","style":3,"background":1046,"log_type":1,"src_id":140303029,"trial_step":29},{"step":30,"content":"此后，这个十三四岁的女孩就在官方记录中失去了踪迹。","style":3,"background":1046,"log_type":1,"src_id":140303030,"trial_step":30},{"step":31,"content":"这么长的时间，她要见证过多少生离死别，才成为了现在这副样子？","style":3,"background":1046,"log_type":1,"src_id":140303031,"trial_step":31},{"step":32,"speaker":"橡木匣","content":"你的神情很恳切，这么想探寻我过去的故事吗？","voice":["vo_trial_40303_1_32"],"voice_bank":"vo_oak_trial","style":1,"background":1046,"log_type":1,"src_id":140303032,"trial_step":32},{"step":33,"content":"作为管理局的局长，也作为你的朋友，我想知道。","style":2,"background":1046,"log_type":1,"src_id":140303033,"trial_step":33},{"step":34,"content":"橡木匣微微笑了起来，但这笑容并没有融化她脸上冰霜覆盖的寒意。","style":3,"background":1046,"log_type":1,"src_id":140303034,"trial_step":34},{"step":35,"speaker":"橡木匣","content":"很好……小家伙，我期待你对这个故事的回应。","voice":["vo_trial_40303_1_35"],"voice_bank":"vo_oak_trial","style":1,"background":1046,"log_type":1,"src_id":140303035,"trial_step":35},{"step":36,"speaker":"橡木匣","content":"这个故事，发生在这片死人坑还没被填埋的时候。","voice":["vo_trial_40303_1_36"],"voice_bank":"vo_oak_trial","style":1,"background":1046,"log_type":1,"src_id":140303036,"trial_step":36},{"step":37,"speaker":"橡木匣","content":"当时，我是这坑中上百名死者的一员，但，我还活着，我是活着被扔进去的。","voice":["vo_trial_40303_1_37"],"voice_bank":"vo_oak_trial","style":1,"background":1046,"log_type":1,"src_id":140303037,"trial_step":37},{"step":38,"content":"血液的气息刺激着鼻腔。小女孩挣扎着睁开了眼睛。","style":3,"background":1046,"log_type":1,"src_id":140303038,"trial_step":38},{"step":39,"content":"好臭、好难闻，想要离开这里。","style":3,"background":1046,"log_type":1,"src_id":140303039,"trial_step":39},{"step":40,"content":"但她发现自己动不了。她的四肢、肚子、肩膀上都压着几乎僵硬了的肢体。她背靠着的躯体，也渐渐变得冰冷。","style":3,"background":1046,"log_type":1,"src_id":140303040,"trial_step":40},{"step":41,"content":"她这才意识到了什么，目光上移，几米之上，是苍灰的天空。","style":3,"background":1046,"log_type":1,"src_id":140303041,"trial_step":41},{"step":42,"content":"而重伤的她待在坑底，无能为力。","style":3,"background":1046,"log_type":1,"src_id":140303042,"trial_step":42},{"step":43,"speaker":"小女孩","content":"我还活着……","voice":["vo_trial_40303_1_43"],"voice_bank":"vo_oak_trial","style":1,"background":1046,"log_type":1,"src_id":140303043,"trial_step":43},{"step":44,"content":"因为虚弱，因为干渴，她只能发出微弱的声音。","style":3,"background":1046,"log_type":1,"src_id":140303044,"trial_step":44},{"step":45,"speaker":"小女孩","content":"有没有人，来救救我……","voice":["vo_trial_40303_1_45"],"voice_bank":"vo_oak_trial","style":1,"background":1046,"log_type":1,"src_id":140303045,"trial_step":45},{"step":46,"content":"不久后，坑外传来了脚步声。","style":3,"background":1046,"log_type":1,"src_id":140303046,"trial_step":46},{"step":47,"content":"两个人站在坑边，看见了坑底睁开眼睛的小女孩。","style":3,"background":1046,"log_type":1,"src_id":140303047,"trial_step":47},{"step":48,"speaker":"小女孩","content":"老神父……医生……","voice":["vo_trial_40303_1_48"],"voice_bank":"vo_oak_trial","style":1,"background":1046,"log_type":1,"src_id":140303048,"trial_step":48},{"step":49,"speaker":"小女孩","content":"救救我……救救我……","voice":["vo_trial_40303_1_49"],"voice_bank":"vo_oak_trial","style":1,"background":1046,"log_type":1,"src_id":140303049,"trial_step":49},{"step":50,"content":"他们似乎说了些什么，片刻后，又一具尸体被扔了下来。","style":3,"background":1046,"log_type":1,"src_id":140303050,"trial_step":50},{"step":51,"speaker":"老神父＆医生","content":"“你当度过苦厄，跨过这世上所有的丰碑，你当遇见金色的游隼，有翅膀的行者牵引你……”","voice":["vo_trial_40303_1_51"],"voice_bank":"vo_oak_trial","style":1,"background":1046,"log_type":1,"src_id":140303051,"trial_step":51},{"step":52,"content":"她就这么听着，看到越来越多的尸体也一起被扔进坑里。一铲子接一铲子的泥土落到头上，盖住了视野。","style":3,"background":1046,"log_type":1,"src_id":140303052,"trial_step":52},{"step":53,"speaker":"小女孩","content":"“你当遇见金色的游隼，有翅膀的行者牵引你，去往光明处。”","voice":["vo_trial_40303_1_53"],"voice_bank":"vo_oak_trial","style":1,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":140303053,"trial_step":53},{"step":54,"speaker":"橡木匣","content":"有什么意义呢？他把我丢进了黑暗之中，却叫我去寻找光。","voice":["vo_trial_40303_1_54"],"voice_bank":"vo_oak_trial","style":1,"background":1046,"log_type":1,"src_id":140303054,"trial_step":54},{"step":55,"content":"橡木匣不急不缓地讲述着，她的声音与执念中小女孩的念诵声逐渐合在一起，你的心底浮起一个朦胧的猜测。","style":3,"background":1046,"log_type":1,"src_id":140303055,"trial_step":55},{"step":56,"speaker":"橡木匣","content":"活人总以为自己的祷词能够超度亡灵，让他们得到解脱。他们借着这样的辞藻粉饰自己犯下的罪行，好像从此就能够被亡灵原谅。","voice":["vo_trial_40303_1_56"],"voice_bank":"vo_oak_trial","style":1,"background":1046,"log_type":1,"src_id":140303056,"trial_step":56},{"step":57,"speaker":"橡木匣","content":"这首诗不会带来光明，那不过是活人为自己开脱、减轻负罪感的借口。","voice":["vo_trial_40303_1_57"],"voice_bank":"vo_oak_trial","style":1,"background":1046,"log_type":1,"src_id":140303057,"trial_step":57},{"step":58,"speaker":"橡木匣","content":"念完了这首诗，逝者的死亡就与生者没有关系了。","voice":["vo_trial_40303_1_58"],"voice_bank":"vo_oak_trial","style":1,"background":1046,"log_type":1,"src_id":140303058,"trial_step":58},{"step":59,"content":"橡木匣好整以暇地看着你。","style":3,"background":1046,"log_type":1,"src_id":140303059,"trial_step":59},{"step":60,"speaker":"橡木匣","content":"好了，小家伙，你听到了你想听的故事……","voice":["vo_trial_40303_1_60"],"voice_bank":"vo_oak_trial","style":1,"background":1046,"log_type":1,"src_id":140303060,"trial_step":60},{"step":61,"speaker":"橡木匣","content":"作为回应，你能给予我指引的回答吗？","voice":["vo_trial_40303_1_61"],"voice_bank":"vo_oak_trial","style":1,"background":1046,"log_type":1,"src_id":140303061,"trial_step":61},{"step":62,"content":"你无法反驳，也无力反驳。有什么词句足够重吗，重到足以安慰一个曾被生者放弃的人？","style":3,"background":1046,"log_type":1,"src_id":140303062,"trial_step":62},{"step":63,"content":"橡木匣耸耸肩，不再多看这片土地一眼，径直朝前走去。","style":3,"background":1046,"log_type":1,"src_id":140303063,"trial_step":63},{"step":64,"content":"你一路上都沉默着，跟着橡木匣来到了一栋破旧的居民楼前。","style":1,"background":1061,"log_type":1,"src_id":140303064,"trial_step":64},{"step":65,"content":"这栋楼已经摇摇欲坠，外面缠满了乱七八糟的电线，楼梯狭窄，你们走进一楼敲门，没有人应。","style":3,"background":1050,"log_type":1,"src_id":140303065,"trial_step":65},{"step":66,"content":"你确定是这里吗？","style":2,"background":1050,"log_type":1,"src_id":140303066,"trial_step":66},{"step":67,"speaker":"橡木匣","content":"我不会记错。","voice":["vo_trial_40303_1_67"],"voice_bank":"vo_oak_trial","style":1,"background":1050,"log_type":1,"src_id":140303067,"trial_step":67},{"step":68,"content":"橡木匣手里不知道什么时候多了一枚铁片，她把铁片滑进门缝，轻松得像在给人做外科手术。门开了，整个门框都抖了一下，看起来随时有可能崩落。","style":3,"background":1050,"log_type":1,"src_id":140303068,"trial_step":68},{"step":69,"content":"门一打开，就有腥臭味扑面而来。几只老鼠尖叫着从你们身边掠过，客厅里堆满各种垃圾，不断有苍蝇从垃圾上起飞，试图降落在你们身上。","style":3,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140303070,"trial_step":70},{"step":70,"content":"你们走过一段没有灯的走廊，灯应该是开着的，你能够听见灯丝里的电流声，但它不亮，也许是开的时间已经太长了。水龙头已经被锈住，偶尔能听见水滴滴落的声音。","style":3,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140303071,"trial_step":71},{"step":71,"speaker":"橡木匣","content":"好的，他还活着。","voice":["vo_trial_40303_1_72"],"voice_bank":"vo_oak_trial","style":1,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140303072,"trial_step":72},{"step":72,"content":"什么？","style":2,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140303073,"trial_step":73},{"step":73,"content":"橡木匣把房间的窗帘拉开，借着窗外微微投来的晨曦，你看见卧室的床上躺着一个人。","style":3,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140303074,"trial_step":74},{"step":74,"content":"大半个身体都瘫缩在一床褪色的旧棉被里，只露出已经干枯发皱的脸和稀疏的白发，如果不是他还在呼吸，你简直要怀疑那是一具已经风干的骷髅。","style":3,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140303075,"trial_step":75},{"step":75,"content":"这就是那个医生吗？","style":2,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140303076,"trial_step":76},{"step":76,"content":"橡木匣没有说话，只是点了点头。她的神情依然淡漠，你看不出她对这样一个局面有怎样的看法。","style":3,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140303077,"trial_step":77},{"step":77,"content":"你凑近那个医生，试图叫醒他。","style":3,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140303078,"trial_step":78},{"step":78,"content":"你好，抱歉打扰。","style":2,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140303079,"trial_step":79},{"step":79,"content":"医生一动不动。你闻到一股浓烈的褥疮的臭味，他可能瘫痪的时间已经不短，疏于照料，他的床铺混合着各种难闻的排泄物气味。","style":3,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140303080,"trial_step":80},{"step":80,"content":"这是……营养液？","style":2,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140303081,"trial_step":81},{"step":81,"content":"你看见床头丢着半瓶没有输完的液体，猜测可能是这东西在维持着他的生命。","style":3,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140303082,"trial_step":82},{"step":82,"content":"一个不死不活的人，关闭了所有沟通的可能性。","style":3,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140303083,"trial_step":83},{"step":83,"speaker":"橡木匣","content":"可惜了，这样的状况，他没有任何价值。","voice":["vo_trial_40303_1_84"],"voice_bank":"vo_oak_trial","style":1,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140303084,"trial_step":84},{"step":84,"content":"什……什么？","style":2,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140303085,"trial_step":85},{"step":85,"speaker":"橡木匣","content":"难道不是吗？他现在这样，连话都说不清楚。","voice":["vo_trial_40303_1_86"],"voice_bank":"vo_oak_trial","style":1,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140303086,"trial_step":86},{"step":86,"speaker":"橡木匣","content":"但如果他死去了，还能借由我的能力，让我们知道些什么。","voice":["vo_trial_40303_1_87"],"voice_bank":"vo_oak_trial","style":1,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140303087,"trial_step":87},{"step":87,"speaker":"橡木匣","content":"死者坦诚，生者遮掩；死者安静，生者聒噪；死者保持着永恒的宁静，从不背叛，而生者制造混乱，是一切恶的根源。","voice":["vo_trial_40303_1_88"],"voice_bank":"vo_oak_trial","style":1,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140303088,"trial_step":88},{"step":88,"speaker":"橡木匣","content":"所以我喜欢死者，比喜欢生者多一些。","voice":["vo_trial_40303_1_89"],"voice_bank":"vo_oak_trial","style":1,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140303089,"trial_step":89},{"step":89,"content":"不知道为什么，你觉得橡木匣说这话的时候，眼神反而变得温柔了。","style":3,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140303090,"trial_step":90},{"step":90,"speaker":"橡木匣","content":"他这个样子，只有死能给予解脱。","voice":["vo_trial_40303_1_91"],"voice_bank":"vo_oak_trial","style":1,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140303091,"trial_step":91},{"step":91,"speaker":"橡木匣","content":"这样的身体，在这个世界上苟延残喘有什么意义呢？活人的世界不需要他，但亡者的世界，一定会欢迎一个脱离俗世的新伙伴。","voice":["vo_trial_40303_1_92"],"voice_bank":"vo_oak_trial","style":1,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140303092,"trial_step":92},{"step":92,"speaker":"橡木匣","content":"我们送他一程吧。","voice":["vo_trial_40303_1_93"],"voice_bank":"vo_oak_trial","style":1,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140303093,"trial_step":93},{"step":93,"speaker":"橡木匣","content":"他会喜欢的。","voice":["vo_trial_40303_1_94"],"voice_bank":"vo_oak_trial","style":1,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140303094,"trial_step":94},{"step":94,"content":"橡木匣的话让你打了个激灵，你终于冷静下来了。","style":3,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140303095,"trial_step":95},{"step":95,"content":"你无法替一个人做活下去还是死去的决定。","style":2,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140303096,"trial_step":96},{"step":96,"content":"如果死亡真的是一种解脱，那你就不会看见这么多亡者的执念了。","style":2,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140303097,"trial_step":97},{"step":97,"speaker":"橡木匣","content":"那是因为，身为生者时，他们尚且不知道作为死者的美好。","voice":["vo_trial_40303_1_98"],"voice_bank":"vo_oak_trial","style":1,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140303098,"trial_step":98},{"step":98,"speaker":"橡木匣","content":"比起活在这样的世上，比起这样活在世上，死亡之地才是救赎。","voice":["vo_trial_40303_1_99"],"voice_bank":"vo_oak_trial","style":1,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140303099,"trial_step":99},{"step":99,"options":["相较于生，死亡才是更简单的决定"],"style":6,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140303100,"trial_step":100,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"相较于生，死亡才是更简单的决定","goto":101}]},{"step":100,"speaker":"橡木匣","content":"或许吧。","voice":["vo_trial_40303_1_101"],"voice_bank":"vo_oak_trial","style":1,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140303101,"trial_step":101},{"step":101,"content":"不是所有人都想被死亡救赎。","style":2,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140303102,"trial_step":102},{"step":102,"content":"正如你所说，这样的活在世上，活在这样的世上……选择生比选择死更加痛苦。","style":2,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140303103,"trial_step":103},{"step":103,"content":"但他仍选择活着。","style":2,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140303104,"trial_step":104},{"step":104,"content":"如果一个人真的想要死去，在必要的时刻，他会传达出来的。","style":2,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140303105,"trial_step":105},{"step":105,"content":"这也是——我对你过去故事的回应。","style":2,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140303106,"trial_step":106},{"step":106,"content":"橡木匣注视着你，忽然向医生走过去，从怀里抽出了什么。","style":3,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140303107,"trial_step":107},{"step":107,"content":"你一惊，刚想阻止，就看见橡木匣抽出的是一方手帕，擦去了医生脸上的污垢。","style":3,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140303108,"trial_step":108},{"step":108,"speaker":"橡木匣","content":"你还想传达什么，就说吧。","voice":["vo_trial_40303_1_109"],"voice_bank":"vo_oak_trial","style":1,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140303109,"trial_step":109},{"step":109,"content":"但医生只是张着嘴，发出艰难的呼吸声。","style":3,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140303110,"trial_step":110},{"step":110,"content":"你不得不自己在这个不大的起居室里四处寻找，试图找到一些别的线索，但这里家徒四壁，你只找到了几本书和一本笔记。","style":3,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140303111,"trial_step":111},{"step":111,"content":"而橡木匣只是站在门口等着，不知在想些什么。","style":3,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140303112,"trial_step":112},{"step":112,"content":"离开前，你为这位医生更换了新的营养液，打扫了一下床铺。忽然发现，他不知道什么时候睁开了眼，正死死盯着橡木匣的背影，嘴巴一张一合。","style":3,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140303113,"trial_step":113},{"step":113,"content":"你凑过去听，听见他嗫嚅着，说出了一个字。","style":3,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140303114,"trial_step":114},{"step":114,"speaker":"医生","content":"……光。","voice":["vo_trial_40303_1_115"],"voice_bank":"vo_oak_trial","style":1,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140303115,"trial_step":115},{"step":115,"speaker":"局长","content":"什么光？","style":2,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140303116,"trial_step":116},{"step":116,"speaker":"医生","content":"……","voice":["vo_trial_40303_1_117"],"voice_bank":"vo_oak_trial","style":1,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140303117,"trial_step":117},{"step":117,"content":"老医生没有回答，似乎说出这个字耗尽了他的力气。他又闭上了眼睛。","style":3,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140303118,"trial_step":118},{"step":118,"content":"你追上橡木匣，她似乎在逃避着什么，你几乎跟不上她。","style":3,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140303119,"trial_step":119},{"step":119,"content":"你心里有很多疑惑，但至少确定了一件事——那块纪念碑上、那个无法解读的执念，和橡木匣有关。","style":3,"background":1051,"log_type":1,"src_id":140303120,"trial_step":120}]}